  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Reading Hei Fan true inheritance, Fang Yuan finds this immortal killer move among more than thirty time path immortal killer moves. At rank six he cannot use it yet and can only look on. It is an offensive killer move. Once the enemy is hit, nothing they do goes smoothly.",
      "chapters": [
        1130
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_hei_fan_true_inheritance",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside years flow execution formation, Fang Yuan has already used it.",
      "chapters": [
        1603
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Compared with Xia Cha’s spring scissors, this move is not that kind of attack, but it still has an immediate impact in battle.",
      "chapters": [
        1602
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xia_cha"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His luck is too dominant, and when Southern Border Gu Immortals have Immortal Gu stolen, most are the cores of their killer moves or Gu that he needs. With its help, those immortals in poor states are susceptible to great thief ghost hand.",
      "chapters": [
        1603
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After a second great thief ghost hand on Xia Cha steals only a rank five mortal Gu, Fang Yuan judges that the move’s effect has already disappeared and that the difference between his luck and Xia Cha’s luck has been reduced by a lot. He continues to use it on Xia Cha while frequently using great thief ghost hand to steal her Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1606
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "effect-duration",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
